{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03572","headline":"游禁苑陪幸临渭亭遇雪应制 · 李峤","name":"游禁苑陪幸临渭亭遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同云接野烟，飞雪暗长天。\n拂树添梅色，过楼助粉妍。\n光含班女扇，韵入楚王弦。\n六出迎仙藻，千箱荅瑞年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03572.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03572","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}